        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Florida Board of Regents, State University System of Florida\n- People: Judy Hample, Mark B. Rosenberg\n- Places: Florida, United States\n- Roles: Chancellor, President\n\nFacts:\n- The Florida Board of Regents was the governing body for the State University System of Florida from 1965 to 2001.\n- The State University System of Florida includes all public universities in the state of Florida, United States.\n- The State University System of Florida is a system of twelve public universities in Florida.\n- Judy Hample is a former chancellor of the Pennsylvania State System of Higher Education and the Florida Board of Regents.\n- Mark B. Rosenberg is the fifth president of Florida International University and a former Chancellor of the State University System of Florida.",
